            "question": "How easy is it to install Screenmate One?",
            "answer": "Installation is simple, non-invasive, and take about 10 minutes. Screenmate One integrates seamlessly with your Tesla’s existing dashboard. No technical expertise is required, and it won’t interfere with your car’s original functionality."
