            "answer": "When Screenmate is \"not powered up\" or not booted for any reason, the Tesla monitor functions as it normally would, as if Screenmate were not installed.          Booting the Screenmate from a “powered off state” (when the car is in deep sleep mode) takes approximately 20-30 seconds. We are also working on a feature that will allow the Screenmate to enter sleep mode alongside the vehicle, rather than shutting down completely."
