          "settings": {
            "question": "Is content playback possible while driving?",
            "answer": "Yes, passengers can watch content while the car is in motion. There are no specific regulations regarding the use of the center screen, and we’ve taken steps to comply with existing guidelines. When a passenger is watching content, they simply press the \"I’m a passenger\" button on the screen. However, it’s always a good idea to double-check local laws to ensure compliance."
          }
